  "description": "The Kilowatt Alloy Comp is built at a killer price with the new Avinox M2 motor producing up to 1100watts of peak power and a punchy 125nm of peak torque allowing you to fly up the climbs ready to attack the next descent. Featuring Nukeproof's signature four bar Horst Link suspension system, a platform that has undergone continuous refinement for over a decade. The result is a proven suspension design that delivers exceptional small bump sensitivity and traction at the start of the travel, while providing the mid stroke support demanded by hard charging riders. Designed to combine the confidence inspiring ride characterises of our multi award-winning Mega, with the versatile adventure ready nature of the Reactor, the Kilowatt is equally at home riding your local trails at the weekend, or on the dreamy singletrack of your bucket list mountain destinations. Blending playful handling with serious capability, Kilowatt is a true do-it-all machine - built to encourage exploration and maximise fun wherever and however you choose to ride.",
